  "refundDraft": {
    "reviewLabel": "Review status:",
    "review": "This draft is pending legal and operational review. Paid checkout must remain disabled until cancellation, withdrawal, tax, and refund operations are verified.",
    "intro": "This policy applies only to a subscription actually purchased through an enabled SpotFinder checkout. Plan previews are not purchases.",
    "withdrawalTitle": "1. Withdrawal rights",
    "withdrawal": "Depending on location and contract, a consumer may have a statutory withdrawal right, including a 14-day period under some European laws. The exact scope, exceptions, notices, and refund calculation need qualified review. Immediate digital-service performance and any proportionate charge may depend on an explicit checkout request and acknowledgement; the current flow has not been verified to collect every required acknowledgement.",
    "cancellationTitle": "2. Cancellation",
    "cancellationOne": "The current app has no verified self-service cancellation portal. Contact spotfinder@icloud.com. Support must confirm completion and effective timing.",
    "cancellationTwo": "Whether access continues to period end and whether a current-period amount is refundable depends on applicable law, checkout terms, and the confirmed Stripe operation.",
    "errorsTitle": "3. Errors and refunds",
    "errors": "For a duplicate, incorrect, or post-cancellation charge, contact spotfinder@icloud.com with the Stripe receipt or transaction identifier. Any approved refund should be returned through Stripe to the original method. No fixed 5–10-day timing is promised because provider and issuer timing has not been operationally verified.",
    "storesTitle": "4. App-store purchases",
    "stores": "No App Store or Google Play purchase path is implemented in the audited web flow. If one is later added, the applicable store process and disclosures must be documented before sale."
  },
